# Hoenn's Hall of Fame (Emerald's MUS_HALL_OF_FAME and its room's): a stately, glowing piece in E-flat major, a trumpet's
# long phrases over warm held strings, horns in half notes, a slow bass and timpani on the strong beats, for the room
# where a new Champion's team is recorded and for the ceremony that follows. A place indoors plays the same by day and
# night. Original composition for this game (plan 21 · H9).
title Hall of Fame (Hoenn)
tempo 80
meter 4/4
reverb 0.42
night none

